Method overview: python plotting/plot_method_overview_figure.py --progression SCC
Figure name: plots/method_SCC_uni2.png

Results of trajectory fidelity: python plotting/plot_trajectory_fidelity.py 
Figure name: plots/trajectory_fidelity/model_comparison_with_null.png

Results of averaged permutation test: python plotting/plot_avg_permutation_results.py
Figure name: plots/permutation permutation_plot_averaged.png

Results of layer emergence: python plotting/plot_layer_analysis.py 
Figure name: plots/emergence/emergence_stacked.png 

Biological plausability: python plotting/plot_cell_pattern_v2.py --input results/crc_conventional_uni2_2000_cellcounts.csv
Figure name: plots/biological_validation_analysis/standardized_abundance.png

